<ecoSpold xmlns="http://www.EcoInvent.org/EcoSpold02">
  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="108afccc-c709-5374-bcd2-9087ca29ce97" activityNameId="af522c11-f9d4-52b1-85fe-d04485884c17" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminium hydroxide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium hydroxide, at plant
Al(OH)3 extraction and calcination to Al2O3 is done in the same plant in line. Only cumulated data for the whole process are available. In- and outputs of AL(OH)3 are calculated according to the stoichiometry (1.530 kg Al(OH)3 --&gt; 1.000 kg Al2O3 + 0.530 kg H2O). Weak data for the energy consumption fractions of the two process parts were available. It is however not known if they relate to wet or dry aluminium hydroxide.;
CAS number: 021645-51-2; 
Formula: Al(OH)3; 
Synonyms: Bayerit, Hydragillit, Gibbsit, Tonerdehydrat, bayerite, hydragillite, gibbsite, diaspore, Al2O3*3H2O, Aluminiumtrihydrate, aluminium hydroxide; 
UUID: 34d9da9b-4ba9-31d2-8e6f-b908c3f99f92
Includes bauxite and ancillary materials with their transports to the calcination plant, the extraction of Al(OH)3 (grinding, digestion and percipitation) and the disposal of the wastes.
Location: Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Technology: Average technology for the aluminium consumed in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature / Survey 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Uncertainty is adjusted for geographical mismatch (using the pedigree matrix).
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_34d9da9b-4ba9-31d2-8e6f-b908c3f99f92.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
